Operational Notes
-----------------
- Ensure MongoDB has sufficient indexes before launch; missing indexes on booking/seat lookup will cause queries to be slow.
- Monitor payments for duplicates: use metadata/stripePaymentIntentId to deduplicate.
- For audit, keep timestamps and consider storing `createdBy`, `updatedBy` where relevant.

